1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:01,140
That's me on the left.

2
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:02,860
Not him. The elbow.

3
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,212
HUS HUS HUS! HUS HUS HUS!

4
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,867
Grandma's old camera gave you three seconds.

5
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:10,270
She had six birthday pictures on her fridge.

6
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,500
I was in four of them.

7
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:14,140
You could tell because I only owned one blue sweater.

8
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:16,820
This year I wanted my face on that fridge.

9
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:18,960
I put tape where my shoes had to land.

10
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,860
My first print was an ear.

11
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,640
My second had eyebrows.

12
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:25,070
Both mine. Things were looking up.

13
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,244
HUS HUS HUS!

14
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:28,500
On Friday my friends came over to test it.

15
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,470
I put one on each side of the tape.

16
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:31,692
HUS HUS HUS!

17
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:34,100
Three seconds later I had the best picture of me

18
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:35,380
anybody had ever taken.

19
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,560
My friends came out as four ears.

20
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:39,950
Ah, almost, almost.

21
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,330
After that I trained with the dining chairs.

22
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:44,210
One wore Grandma's glasses.

23
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:45,820
One wore my uncle's hat.

24
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:48,500
If the hat disappeared, it didn't count.

25
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:50,260
I stopped aiming for the middle.

26
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:51,940
I aimed between the hats.

27
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:54,089
HUS HUS HUS! HUS HUS HUS!

28
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,730
At Grandma's birthday they left me a spot.

29
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,360
My uncle put the cake in it.

30
00:00:58,550 --> 00:01:00,240
The red light was already blinking.

31
00:01:00,510 --> 00:01:01,940
I went behind him this time.

32
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:04,270
He leaned left. I leaned right.

33
00:01:04,390 --> 00:01:05,552
HUS HUS HUS!

34
00:01:06,090 --> 00:01:07,930
Grandma took the elbow off the fridge.

35
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:09,650
She put us all up there instead.

36
00:01:10,350 --> 00:01:11,950
Then a couple handed me the camera.

37
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:14,110
Could you take one of just the two of us?

38
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:15,100
I said sure.

39
00:01:15,550 --> 00:01:16,578
HUS HUS HUS!
